    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:352d28bf686b33d77d1f9013",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "顺利结束有马纪念的迷人景致。\n或许因为比赛本身的关注度很高、\n她的名字在社会上传播得更广了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c52889d5cb2d9c445734ce226dc8bda313e97cef939c913b4d2adb2eea8616",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
